          "id": "df-f69537bb31d9474b5a51",
          "title": "Release-issue markers are accepted outside trusted App release PRs",
          "details": "assertPullPolicy parses or rejects darkfactory:release-issues only when engineAutomation is true. A non-App PR with an authorized association, an ordinary closing reference, and a valid, malformed, or duplicate reserved marker bypasses releaseIssueNumbers and can be admitted. The marker must be rejected everywhere except an exact trusted App-authored release/ PR, with regression coverage for non-engine ordinary and reconciliation branches.",
          "path": ".github/scripts/run-darkfactory-autoreview.mjs",
          "line": 470
        },
        {
          "id": "df-516f2f80496c862c8c86",
          "title": "Final-review provenance does not establish a clean medium round",
          "details": "The trusted verified state identifies the open exact head but contains no durable medium-review clean evidence for that target version. Final approval requires an independently verifiable clean medium-tier round before this high-tier confirmation; untrusted PR claims cannot supply that provenance.",
